{"id":21,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Inept at flying high. However, it can fly around very fast to protect its territory."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Due to its short wings, it can’t fly long distances. It wanders about restlessly and pecks at bug Pokémon."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Its reckless nature leads it to stand up to others—even large Pokémon—if it has to protect its territory."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Farmers whose fields are troubled by bug Pokémon appreciate Spearow for its vigorous appetite and look after it."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its short wings make it inept at flying. It moves about hurriedly and pecks at Bug-type Pokémon in the tall grass."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Spearow has a very loud cry that can be heard over half a mile away. If its high, keening cry is heard echoing all around, it is a sign that they are warning each other of danger."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"Eats bugs in grassy areas. It has to flap its short wings at high speed to stay airborne."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Very protective of its territory, it flaps its short wings busily to dart around at high speed."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It flaps its small wings busily to fly. Using its beak, it searches in grass for prey."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It flaps its short wings to flush out insects from tall grass. It then plucks them with its stubby beak."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"It busily flits around here and there. Even if it is frail, it can be a tough foe that uses MIRROR MOVE."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its loud cry can be heard over half a mile away. If its high, keening cry is heard echoing all around, it is a sign that they are warning each other of danger."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"To protect its territory, it flies around ceaselessly, making high- pitched cries."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Keen Eye","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered."},{"name":"Sniper","hidden":true,"description":"If the Pokémon's attack lands a critical hit, the attack is powered up even further."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Brown","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":21,"name":"Spearow","condition":null,"children":[{"id":22,"name":"Fearow","condition":"Lv. 20","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Ultra Sun / Ultra Moon","level":[[1,45],[1,64],[4,43],[8,228],[11,31],[15,332],[18,119],[22,372],[25,97],[29,116],[32,355],[36,65]],"machine":[332,213,590,104,497,263,206,19,218,237,182,240,156,216,355,496,214,211,164,241,207,168,92,369,526],"egg":[310,297,185,98,13,184,143,211,161,253,18],"tutor":[432,529,257,143,173,366,253]},"cards":[{"id":"me1-151","name":"Spearow","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"151","artist":null,"img":"me1/151"},{"id":"me1-102","name":"Spearow","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Common","number":"102","artist":null,"img":"me1/102"},{"id":"sv3pt5-21","name":"Spearow","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Common","number":"21","artist":"Gemi","img":"sv3pt5/21"},{"id":"swsh5-111","name":"Spearow","set":"Battle Styles","date":"2021-03-19","rarity":"Common","number":"111","artist":"Sekio","img":"swsh5/111"},{"id":"sm10-145","name":"Spearow","set":"Unbroken Bonds","date":"2019-05-03","rarity":"Common","number":"145","artist":"tetsuya koizumi","img":"sm10/145"},{"id":"sm1-97","name":"Spearow","set":"Sun & Moon","date":"2017-02-03","rarity":"Common","number":"97","artist":"Yukiko Baba","img":"sm1/97"},{"id":"xy6-65","name":"Spearow","set":"Roaring Skies","date":"2015-05-06","rarity":"Common","number":"65","artist":"Masakazu Fukuda","img":"xy6/65"},{"id":"xy4-78","name":"Spearow","set":"Phantom For